# The pinned upstream inputs in provider-dev/downloaded/ ARE committed (the
# NVCF spec, the harvested NGC definitions, the ngcsdk-derived schemas and
# the download manifest): every refresh is then a reviewable diff against
# the hash pins in provider-dev/config/spec_pin.json. So are
# provider-dev/source (split and normalized service specs),
# provider-dev/openapi (the generated provider),
# provider-dev/config/all_services.csv (the mapping contract) and
# website/docs (so pages stamp with their regeneration date).

# the pinned PyPI wheel cached by harvest_ngc_sdk_schemas.mjs (the derived
# ngc_sdk_schemas.json IS committed)
*.whl

# integration test registry copy (rebuilt every run)
tests/integration/.registry-tmp/
